## Why This Is Asked
Tests end-to-end data flow, multilingual handling, privacy, and basic searchability in a beginner-friendly setup.

## Key Concepts
- Event-driven architecture (S3, EventBridge, Step Functions)
- Language detection, translation fallback
- Comprehend sentiment/keywords, PII redaction
- Data lineage: S3, DynamoDB, OpenSearch
- IAM least privilege, encryption, dead-letter queues

## Code Example
```javascript
// Skeleton Lambda redacts PII from transcript text
exports.handler = async (event) => {
  const text = event.transcript;
  const redacted = text.replace(/[0-9]{12}/g, "[REDACTED_SSN]");
  return { redacted };
}
```

